==Icelandic==
{{Is-Numeral(fjórir)|}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non}} ''[[#Old Norse|fjórir]]''.

===Numeral===
'''fjórir''' {{m|p}}, '''[[fjórar]]''' {{f|p}}, '''[[fjögur]]''' {{n|p}}

# '''[[four]]'''; the cardinal number after [[þrír#Icelandic|þrír]] and before [[fimm#Icelandic|fimm]].
#: ''[[sjá|Sjáðu]]! '''Fjórir''' [[maður#Icelandic|menn]].''
#:: [[look|Look]]! '''Four''' [[man|men]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[fjórði]] {{m}}, [[fjórða]] {{f|n}}

====Derived terms====
* [[klukkan fjögur]]
* [[undir fjögur augu]]
* [[á fjórum fótum]]

===See also===
* [[fjarki]] {{pos n}}

